Template files for the minimum recommended DwC-A Event core publishing model for biological survey and monitoring data. Terms were selected based on the fact that minimum a data user should be able to do with a survey or monitoring dataset is to infer absence information. 

## Files
* Min-SAM-Pub-Mod_TEMPLATE.xlsx: Excel spreadsheet containing the ReadMe file and each table in the template as indibidual tabs.
* Min-SAM-Pub-Mod_TEMPLATE_README.csv: Template ReadMe as .csv
* Min-SAM-Pub-Mod_TEMPLATE_occurrence.csv: Occurrence extension (https://rs.gbif.org/core/dwc_occurrence_2025-07-10.xml) table as .csv 
* Min-SAM-Pub-Mod_TEMPLATE_emof.csv: Extended measurements or facts extension (emof; https://rs.gbif.org/extension/obis/extended_measurement_or_fact_2023-08-28.xml) table as .csv
* Min-SAM-Pub-Mod_TEMPLATE_survey.csv: Survey table, containg Event core (https://rs.gbif.org/core/dwc_event_2025-07-10.xml) and Humboldt extension (https://rs.gbif.org/extension/eco/humboldt_2025-07-10.xml) terms as .csv 
